# Previously-packed tarballs. Without this, `npm pack` sweeps up the .tgz
# sitting in this directory from the last pack and nests it inside the new
# one — 0.10.0-solana.8 was 335 KB, of which 220 KB was a verbatim copy of
# 0.10.0-solana.7. The vendored artifact in burner-app is git-tracked, so that
# bloat would have landed in the app repo permanently.
*.tgz

# Test fixtures and build config are not needed by consumers.
test/
tsconfig.json
